  "body": "Explain all110 retained provider version misses using a separate, bounded DATA witness report. Every witness retains the strict miss and checks the original version-library selection and definition, the pinned stub's direct dependency on libc, and the exact ordinary libc name/type/version export. The consumed314source files and both earlier acceptance verdicts remain unchanged.\n\nA source/CI-bound read-only auditor reauthenticates the fixed existing SDK3 run/job/artifact, rehashes retained carrier/provider DATA, validates full build evidence and recomputes the static gate before producing witnesses. No rebuild, request activation, download, extraction, image operation, target execution, runtime/ABI/closure admission, merge or environment publication. All6legacy strict blocks remain; Stage7 remains incomplete and strict0/4FAIL.\n\nValidation:17focusedPASS; full1870cases1863PASS7skip (ordinary/tmp plus3actual/dev/shm cases). Sole fresh wholebranch review found one Important contradictory version-index case, reproduced RED\u2192GREEN and fixed in one pass. Exact sourceCI and actual audit precede final closeout. Observed results and evidence will be recorded here.\n",
